WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.030
In a Jain temple, worshippers bow
before images of 24 great teachers.

2
00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.060
Yet Jains believe in no creator god.

3
00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:11.980
For them, the universe was never made.

4
00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:14.740
And these teachers do not answer prayers.

5
00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:20.320
Jains call them ford-makers: they made
a crossing over the river of rebirth.

6
00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:24.860
So if no god saves them, what
are Jains trying to become?

7
00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:28.730
In this mission, you'll find
out why Jains see karma as fine,

8
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:31.790
invisible matter that sticks to the soul.

9
00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:37.070
Then you'll meet the five vows, and see
why many Jains won't eat after sunset.

10
00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.510
Your mission: find out what
Jains are trying to become,

11
00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.110
and how they hope to get there.
